  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(8 fotos) El restaurant L&#39;Horta Nova, en el Club de Campo de Onda, sigue con su intensa actividad cultural y musical. Este domingo ha sido el turno de Lorenzo Millo, en el momento del verm&uacute;, entre las 12 y las 14 horas. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_0315.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">El mi&eacute;rcoles, a partir de las 20 horas, el tardeo estar&aacute; a cargo del &#39;blues man&#39; Edu Big Hands.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/04/EduLhortaNovaDimecres31.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">Hasta el 11 de septiembre, todav&iacute;a se puede ver la exposici&oacute;n Caos, obras abstractas en t&eacute;cnicas mixtas de Andre Dilara, nombre art&iacute;stico de Andreea Ciurea.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/ExpoDijous11ClubCamp.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 679px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">Durante todo el verano, L&#39;Horta Nova ha presentado una completa programaci&oacute;n cultural y musical, que tendr&aacute; continuidad en septiembe.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lorenzomillolhortanovaonda/edulhortanovadimecres31.jpg\" alt=\"edulhortanovadimecres31\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lorenzomillolhortanovaonda/img_0306.jpg\" alt=\"img_0306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lorenzomillolhortanovaonda/img_0308.jpg\" alt=\"img_0308\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lorenzomillolhortanovaonda/img_0310.jpg\" alt=\"img_0310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lorenzomillolhortanovaonda/img_0312.jpg\" alt=\"img_0312\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lorenzomillolhortanovaonda/img_0314.jpg\" alt=\"img_0314\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lorenzomillolhortanovaonda/img_0315.jpg\" alt=\"img_0315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lorenzomillolhortanovaonda/img_0320.jpg\" alt=\"img_0320\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
